    <string name="textures_rules_title">Accepted files</string>
    <string name="textures_rules">• Name: HASH_WIDTHxHEIGHT_FORMAT.png or .dds (16 hex characters + the ORIGINAL size), for example 1F1ED618559910C0_256x1024_DXT3.png\n• PNG (any type) or DDS DXT1/DXT3/DXT5 or 32-bit uncompressed\n• Size: 1, 2, 3 or 4 times the original, same factor on both sides (same aspect ratio), up to 16384 px\n• Only textures that were DXT or RGBA8 in the game are replaced\n• To get the original textures with the right names, use texturas_originales.py from the PC Modding Kit</string>
    <string name="textures_vulkan_note">On Android (Vulkan) the game loads packs, but cannot dump textures or upscale them automatically (that is D3D12-only on PC). Changes apply the next time the game opens.</string>
